<description>&lt;p&gt;Separatist leader Lucas Ayaba pleaded not guilty at a war-crimes trial in Norway, indicating international legal scrutiny of the Anglophone conflict. Boko Haram insurgents have reappeared in northern Cameroon, adding a new security threat to the already volatile region. In a remote national park, elephants killed a Swiss tourist and wounded a British and an American hiker, forcing other hikers to hide in tree stumps. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE92TUw0ZHByeWdBYktVZHVxWURiQWFqU1V4RlNoaWd5STJmWkh1OXVpV05pQzJKU3F3b09uOFdGclRra0tGVlluR29IeUZ1S1lTMGFvM0NyN2NUTnZiOUHSAWNBVV95cUxNXzZxVWc5SDdlelRTRUE0YlpWRWlITkVkRmV4eWJlSGszSnRwQUZ4V1k5cHZ5WkM4Z1Z3RHBQM2RSZVNiYlNQMllfZ1NoYmctX0JWSnUxdXJRWFVIMUlDckplY1U?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5pX1JobmRlOFhfMGc1OHpMUkNzak5KRFptS1B0RmJSYS1CRnNaUjkyVXU2QXhvNGZKYW1mX2ZkNDJSeG96VnhhSHJQU0dGRmJ4eENIM0NqNTdsdk9CRHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNeWpNNmgtX0w0RzVaTjFRTVVCWlEyek90cm1Pa0J3V1BJRVpzQ2o0SXhib2ZlbEtPcUtFaF9DU0JqYkxBY2o5ZDI4X0xTNklZR2hDSXlSZXN5RzZRUmZwcEk2VUU3aHdHckVjY2M0S1Y3UHlPZFVPVDdaMk55ekgwV3BXRU9YV3dXcjliVjhKS0FETkpP?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE5YSW9MUkNWdUdlSV84U05FZUdrekFzWW1QQmNYSWt0MnFQTHhlTFctS013YW1qbXZhZ19LcVVObjRKOVI3c21OdlFTX0VmTXEzZGc3MlhVdWYtcjFIR2NOY3FVZkRweUYwc1dNWmJ4aVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Wide Open Country&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE1jVm5XS1hZbVFjaVVHd0lYX3l5ZzRjcVNsZlhDMHNPQURodnhqVFFLcVRnbEZlcDA0cFRMOF9lamRKMTNoVDEzeW